# @domain: policies
# #4964 — one violation of data-domain-is-punned-owl-class: a Domain that is not an owl:Class.
@prefix chorus: <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<urn:chorus:domains:domains> { chorus:zzDomain a chorus:Domain . chorus:zzPunned a chorus:Domain , owl:Class . }
